SUMMARY="A post-modern text editor"
DESCRIPTION="Helix is a terminal-based modal text editor, with an emphasis on \
discoverability and sane defaults.

Features include:
- Multiple selections
- Tree-sitter integration
- Powerful code manipulation
- Language server support
- Fuzzy find, themes, and more."
